  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the pre and post activities of the Presidential Delivery Unit (PDU) in the execution of the EU-Zambia Lobito Corridor Business Forum (LCBF).</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The PDU is an arm of government that coordinates the implementation of high-priority projects by government ministries. The &lt;strong&gt;objective of the PDU is to fast track the delivery of high-priority government initiatives that have the potential to bring lasting benefits to the Zambian people, and one of these projects is the Lobito Corridor&lt;/strong&gt;. In this way, the PDU has become the direct point of contact and strategic partner for the European Union concerning the Lobito Corridor, including, therefore, also the EU-Zambia LCBF.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
